{{Quote|Remember, when that sun is gone, that weapon will be ready to fire! But as long as there's light, we got a chance.|[[Poe Dameron]], to his fellow [[Resistance pilot]]s|<ref name="Episode VII" />}}
During the [[Cold War|conflict]] between the [[First Order]] and the [[Resistance]], the First Order drained a '''star''' in order to power [[Starkiller Base]], a [[superweapon]] that positioned itself near this star, so it could be used to destroy the [[Resistance base]] on [[D'Qar]]. Starkiller Base extinguished the [[star]]'s light completely,<ref name="awakensnovel" /> but the [[Resistance Starfighter Corps]] [[Battle of Starkiller Base|destroyed]] the superweapon before it could be used to eliminate the Resistance. When the planet imploded, the stored energy created a [[Solo (star)|new star]] causing the system to have twin suns.<ref name="Episode VII" /><ref name="awakensnovel" />

